  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"992\">\n<li data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"877\">\n<p data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"877\">LP-PLA2 is a <strong data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"822\">vascular-specific inflammatory enzyme</strong>, primarily associated with <strong data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"876\">atherosclerotic plaque</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"989\">\n<p data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"989\">Elevated activity indicates <strong data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"938\">higher cardiovascular risk</strong>, especially <strong data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"988\">stroke and coronary heart disease</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1018\"><strong data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1017\">Interpretation Guide</strong>:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1131\">\n<li data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1067\">\n<p data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1067\"><strong data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1042\">&lt; 225 nmol/min/mL</strong> &ndash; <em data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1067\">Low to Moderate Risk</em></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1131\">\n<p data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1131\"><strong data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1091\">&ge; 225 nmol/min/mL</strong> &ndash; <em data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1131\">High Risk for Cardiovascular Events</em></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
